   "design": "The ground station codes the sounding message from the received profile, and the meteorologist checks it before it is sent. The launch log takes the sonde serial from a barcode scan and the time and surface observations from the station, and the meteorologist adds remarks. The monthly report comes from the station's own records, with measured values, not planned ones. Preparing, filling, launching, monitoring, profile checks, maintenance and orders stay with the meteorologist.",
